      "en": "Tempo the turtle plans the whole day in order! Some things happen BEFORE, some DURING, and some AFTER. Read the sentence and tap the time word that fits. A Grade 1 grammar game about using time prepositions (before, during, after), aligned to Common Core L.1.1.i.",
